<title>POLAND: Polish wheat, rye and barley prices lower.</title>
<headline>Polish wheat, rye and barley prices lower.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Agriculture Ministry said in a statement that the average price of wheat, rye and barley fell at last week's grain auctions.</p>
<p>POLISH FARM AUCTION PRICES (AVERAGE)</p>
<p>  Product   week to Nov 9    previous week    yr/yr change</p>
<p>   Wheat	62.85 zl/q	 63.63 zl/q	   57.5 pct</p>
<p>   Rye	  42.04 zl/q	 43.68 zl/q	   55.6 pct</p>
<p>   Barley     53.25 zl/q	 54.00 zl/q	   47.2 pct</p>
<p>NOTE: zl/q = zlotys per quintal.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
